摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"dsh Web GUI 技能中枢：浏览/搜索全部本地技能、按技能或分组启停；安装前审计拦截隐藏字符与管道执行、一键修 frontmatter；内置 GitHub 市场（commit 钉住来源）、本地改动检测、跨 agent 导入、可恢复回收站。 dsh web GUI skill hub: browse/search all local skills, per-skill/group toggles, install-time audit (hidden chars, pipe-to-shell), GitHub market with commit p","id":"gh:1334303719","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-skill-hub","slug":"cheshireez/dsh-skill-hub","topics":["agent-skills","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","skill","skill-hub","skills"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"dsh Web GUI 技能中枢：浏览/搜索全部本地技能、按技能或分组启停；安装前审计拦截隐藏字符与管道执行、一键修 frontmatter；内置 GitHub 市场（commit 钉住来源）、本地改"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"动检测、跨 agent 导入、可恢复回收站。 dsh web GUI skill hub: browse/search all local skills, per-skill/group toggle"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"s, install-time audit (hidden chars, pipe-to-shell), GitHub market with commit p"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-skill-hub"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文版 | English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"In-GUI skill hub for DeepSeek Harness — manage the full `ctx.skills` catalog from the Web GUI. Beyon"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"d browsing, toggling and market installs, it puts the weight on two things: **audit before install**"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" (hidden characters, remote-execution pipes, credential paths, size caps — a blocking finding is ref"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"used before it lands) and **budget after install** (the name + description characters of the first p"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"rogressive-disclosure layer, so you learn at 8000 that a skill would install but never trigger)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> Host runs in the dsh process via official SDKs only; browser renders through official slots. No ds"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"e dsh process via official SDKs only; browser renders through official slots. No dsh source changes."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Requires `Node ^22.19 || >=24` + dsh web `>=0.1.7-alpha.1 <0.3`. dsh `0.2.2` and later require `Node"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"`Node ^22.19 || >=24` + dsh web `>=0.1.7-alpha.1 <0.3`. dsh `0.2.2` and later require `Node >=24.9`."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Two surfaces — the hub panel lives at **Settings → Skills Hub**, and this plugin's own configuration"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" card sits on the plugin's page in the **Plugins manager** (sidebar → 插件 → dsh-skill-hub). The card "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"is registered by the plugin itself into the `plugins.bundle.config` slot — dsh has no auto-generated"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" config page — and covers the master switch, announce-to-agent, dot colors, usage display and the st"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"ats window/interval."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**Settings → Skills Hub** — 4 tabs: **General** (all skills, viewed all / by source / by location / "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"by role), **Workspace** (project skills for the selected workspace), **Market** (install + update), "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"**Trash** (restorable removed skills)."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The same hub is available as a **960px sidebar panel** (left rail → Plugins area → Skills Hub), so s"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"kills can be browsed without leaving the conversation."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- **Browse** — every root of the `ctx.skills` registry: project / user / bundled + third-party provi"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ders. Search across name, description, `displayName`; filter by source, status (enabled / disabled),"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" and invocation (model / user); sort by name, added time, or usage. Every row has a `⋯` menu for det"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"ail / toggle / delete, so actions do not depend on edit mode. Same-name skills from different source"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"s get a duplicate badge instead of silently hiding.\n- **Content audit** — enabled skills' bodies (`S"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"KILL.md`) are checked too: raw ESC control characters, Unicode tag characters, and bidirectional con"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"trols (these three make \"reviewed\" not equal \"seen\" — a market import carrying them is refused outri"},{"id":"p13s8","text":"ght), zero-width characters, `curl … | sh` remote execution, SSH/cloud-credential/keychain paths, ov"},{"id":"p13s9","text":"er-long descriptions, and the 2 MiB per-file / 10 MiB per-skill / 500-file limits. Pure local static"},{"id":"p13s10","text":" matching: no model call, no network. A market import scans the whole bundle (including `scripts/`);"},{"id":"p13s11","text":" the standing check only reads `SKILL.md` — it runs on every 5-second poll, and walking every direct"},{"id":"p13s12","text":"ory would slow the panel down.\n- **Announcement budget** — the name + description total that the fir"},{"id":"p13s13","text":"st progressive-disclosure layer injects comes back with the catalog, so the panel can show character"},{"id":"p13s14","text":"s and an estimated token count; past 8000 characters it turns red (clients truncate the tail there, "},{"id":"p13s15","text":"which shows up as \"installed but never triggers\").\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Content audit and announcement budget"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Capability | What it does |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Content audit | Raw ESC / Unicode tag characters / bidirectional controls / zero-width characters "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"/ `curl … \\| sh` / SSH and cloud credential paths / 2 MiB per file, 10 MiB per skill, 500 files. A b"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"locking finding refuses the write (a market import is refused as a whole and its temp directory remo"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"ved); warnings are only flagged. Pure local static matching: no network, no model call. |\n| Announce"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"ment budget | The name + description total of the first progressive-disclosure layer comes back with"},{"id":"p16s6","text":" the catalog, so the panel shows characters and an estimated token count; past 8000 it turns red — c"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"lients truncate the tail there, which shows up as \"installed but never triggers\". |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Scaffold format (`SKILL.md`):"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Host uses only `ctx.skills.snapshot/get`, `ctx.webServer.register`, `ctx.systemPrompt.section`. Rout"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"es sit behind dsh's own `/api` trust fence (loopback / the listener's bind address / `--trusted-host"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"`), JSON; **write routes (POST) additionally require an `x-dsh-skill-hub: 1` header** — a cross-site"},{"id":"p21s4","text":" page cannot forge a custom header, and a same-origin request skips the CORS preflight so it costs n"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"o extra round trip. The provider registers in the global skill layer and once more into every live a"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"gent's skill layer (nearer than the preset layer), so an invocation override can outrank the host's "},{"id":"p21s7","text":"yer (nearer than the preset layer), so an invocation override can outrank the host's native entries."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## HTTP API"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| `/api/skill-hub/catalog?cwd=` | GET | skills + disabled + diagnostics + duplicates |\n| `/api/skill"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"-hub/skill?name=&cwd=` | GET | skill body (works for disabled too) |\n| `/api/skill-hub/skill/delete`"},{"id":"p24s3","text":" | POST | move to trash (snapshots source+roles) |\n| `/api/skill-hub/toggle` | POST | `{name, enable"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"d}` |\n| `/api/skill-hub/toggle-batch` | POST | `{names, enabled}` |\n| `/api/skill-hub/create` | POST"},{"id":"p24s5","text":" | `{name, description?, root?}` |\n| `/api/skill-hub/diagnostic/fix` | POST | `{path}` auto-fix fron"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"tmatter |\n| `/api/skill-hub/stats` | GET | invocation counts |\n| `/api/skill-hub/config` | GET/POST "},{"id":"p24s7","text":"| runtime config (`null` clears) |\n| `/api/skill-hub/groups` | GET | tags + collections + orders |\n|"},{"id":"p24s8","text":" `/api/skill-hub/tag` etc. | POST | create/rename, delete, set members, reorder |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
